# Comma-separated VLESS UUIDs allowed to use /connect. Leave unset to accept any
# UUID, which turns the Worker into an open proxy for anyone who finds the path.
# Set on deployed Workers with `bunx wrangler secret put VLESS_USERS`.
# VLESS_USERS=3baf7c1e-2d48-4f6a-9c05-8e1d7a4b2f60

# NAT64 prefix to retry through, on the original port, when the edge refuses to
# dial the destination outright (it will not dial Cloudflare IPs). Appending a
# dotted IPv4 address must form an IPv6 address. Unset disables the fallback.
# NAT64_PREFIX=2a01:4f9:c010:3f02:64:0:
